  "description": "A production-ready .NET library for integrating with Odoo ERP via JSON-RPC.\n      Supports authentication, generic ORM (search_read / create / write / unlink),\n      Sales Orders, Invoicing, Inventory and Products — with a fluent domain filter\n      builder and full Microsoft DI / IHttpClientFactory support.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "OdooConnector",
  "isPrerelease": false,
