  "published": "2026-09-08T09:42:08.42Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 — Initial release.\n      - JSON-RPC 2.0 HTTP client\n      - Authentication and session management\n      - Generic ORM: SearchRead, Read, Create, Write, Unlink, FieldsGet, SearchCount\n      - Fluent OdooDomain filter builder\n      - SalesService: orders, order lines, customers\n      - InvoicingService: invoices, bills, overdue detection\n      - InventoryService: products, stock quants, low-stock alerts\n      - Microsoft DI extension: AddOdooConnector()\n      - Targets net6.0 and net8.0",
